  Slug: impostor-in-hidden-places
  DisplayName: Impostor in Hidden Places
  IconPath: icons/creatures/magical/humanoid-silhouette-dashing-blue.webp
  Description: 'Impostors in hidden places whisper in quiet corners where mortal
    voices rarely resound, hoarding secrets and pondering unknowable truths. They
    often bring misfortune to those who disturb them, though an animist who earns
    their trust will find that they make effective allies. Apparition Skills Fortune-Telling
    Lore, Underworld Lore Apparition Spells Cantrip @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Telekinetic
    Hand] 1st @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Ill Omen] 2nd @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Invisibility]
    3rd @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Veil of Privacy] 4th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Liminal
    Doorway] 5th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Strange Geometry] 6th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mislead]
    7th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Planar Palace] 8th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Disappearance]
    9th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Phantasmagoria] Vessel Spell @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Discomfiting
    Whispers] Avatar Whisper Hiding in Shadows Speed 50 feet, fly Speed 50 feet Melee
    1 shadowed touch (reach 15 feet, versatile cold), Damage @Damage[(6d10+6)[void]]
    Ranged 1 whisper of despair (range 120 feet), Damage @Damage[(6d6+6)[void]]'
